<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Dead Sea Works Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Israel's Dead Sea Works Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dead Sea Works Ltd, a subsidiary of Israel Chemicals Ltd, reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  341,313    288,468</p>
<p>Operating profit	63,281     48,079</p>
<p>Net Profit		37,351     35,539</p>
<p>($1=3.40 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
